+  {t:'Nothing here — the bug must be in the interrupt handler',c:false,w:'The ~59× factor is the arithmetic fingerprint of a 16-bit truncation of 200000 (200000/3392 ≈ 59). The config write is the bug, and width rejection now catches it in simulation.'},
