+{id:'b2',ch:'bug',type:'w',
+ q:'Describe the double-store bug class in general terms: what creates it, why it is worse than a missing feature, and how the a20fbb1 fix pattern (delete-and-delegate) prevents its recurrence. Give the PWM duty-cycle example.',
+ c:[{l:'created when two API names get two backing stores for one hardware register',t:['two stores','two names','independent','duplicate','one register']},
